  "description" : "Feature-level fusion of already-coregistered optical and SAR temporal feature rasters. Both inputs must share the SAME pixel grid (width, height, geotransform, CRS); the operator verifies the grid signature and concatenates bands as opt_<name> / sar_<name> with fusion provenance metadata. Registration, resampling and reprojection are NOT performed \u2014 a grid mismatch is a typed error, keeping 'coregister' and 'fuse' as separate, explicit steps.",
